{"id":"ce9e31006040dc50","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-frobenius-reciprocity.md","title":"Pointwise Frobenius Reciprocity Data","display":"df-frobenius-reciprocity — Pointwise Frobenius Reciprocity Data","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-frobenius-reciprocity","aliases":["58-df-frobenius-reciprocity"],"display":"df-frobenius-reciprocity — Pointwise Frobenius Reciprocity Data","depends_on":["[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-powerset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-frobenius-reciprocity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-frobenius-reciprocity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-frobenius-reciprocity — Pointwise Frobenius Reciprocity Data"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"58-df-powerset\">58-df-powerset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U,\\mathcal R_H,\\mathcal R_G,\\operatorname{Ind},\\operatorname{Res},\\operatorname{Hom}_H,\\operatorname{Hom}_G,\\Phi\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal U,\\mathcal R_H,\\mathcal R_G,\\operatorname{Ind},\\operatorname{Res},\\operatorname{Hom}_H,\\operatorname{Hom}_G,\\Phi\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_H,\\mathcal R_G\\subseteq\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal R_H,\\mathcal R_G\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\)</span> are fixed set-sized collections of representations</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FrobeniusReciprocity}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FrobeniusReciprocity}_S\\)</span> is the eight-place predicate defined below</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}frobenius\\text{-}reciprocity}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FrobeniusReciprocity}_S(\\mathcal U,\\mathcal R_H,\\mathcal R_G,\\operatorname{Ind},\\operatorname{Res},\\operatorname{Hom}_H,\\operatorname{Hom}_G,\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\mathcal R_H\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\land\\mathcal R_G\\subseteq\\mathcal U\n\\land\\operatorname{Ind}:\\mathcal R_H\\to\\mathcal R_G\n\\land\\operatorname{Res}:\\mathcal R_G\\to\\mathcal R_H\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Hom}_H:\\mathcal R_H\\times\\mathcal R_H\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal U)\n\\land\\operatorname{Hom}_G:\\mathcal R_G\\times\\mathcal R_G\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal U)\n\\land\\Phi:\\mathcal R_H\\times\\mathcal R_G\\to\\mathcal U\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall U\\in\\mathcal R_H\\;\\forall W\\in\\mathcal R_G\\;\\Bigl[\n\\Phi(U,W):\\operatorname{Hom}_G(\\operatorname{Ind}(U),W)\\to\\operatorname{Hom}_H(U,\\operatorname{Res}(W))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall f,g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_G(\\operatorname{Ind}(U),W)\\;\\bigl(\\Phi(U,W)(f)=\\Phi(U,W)(g)\\to f=g\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_H(U,\\operatorname{Res}(W))\\;\\exists f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_G(\\operatorname{Ind}(U),W)\\;\\bigl(\\Phi(U,W)(f)=h\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}frobenius\\text{-}reciprocity}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FrobeniusReciprocity}_S(\\mathcal U,\\mathcal R_H,\\mathcal R_G,\\operatorname{Ind},\\operatorname{Res},\\operatorname{Hom}_H,\\operatorname{Hom}_G,\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\mathcal R_H\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\land\\mathcal R_G\\subseteq\\mathcal U\n\\land\\operatorname{Ind}:\\mathcal R_H\\to\\mathcal R_G\n\\land\\operatorname{Res}:\\mathcal R_G\\to\\mathcal R_H\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Hom}_H:\\mathcal R_H\\times\\mathcal R_H\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal U)\n\\land\\operatorname{Hom}_G:\\mathcal R_G\\times\\mathcal R_G\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal U)\n\\land\\Phi:\\mathcal R_H\\times\\mathcal R_G\\to\\mathcal U\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall U\\in\\mathcal R_H\\;\\forall W\\in\\mathcal R_G\\;\\Bigl[\n\\Phi(U,W):\\operatorname{Hom}_G(\\operatorname{Ind}(U),W)\\to\\operatorname{Hom}_H(U,\\operatorname{Res}(W))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall f,g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_G(\\operatorname{Ind}(U),W)\\;\\bigl(\\Phi(U,W)(f)=\\Phi(U,W)(g)\\to f=g\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_H(U,\\operatorname{Res}(W))\\;\\exists f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_G(\\operatorname{Ind}(U),W)\\;\\bigl(\\Phi(U,W)(f)=h\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The predicate records the pointwise Hom-set bijections after the two representation collections and their Hom-sets have been supplied explicitly.</li>\n<li>Naturality is not hidden in the notation: a full induction-restriction adjunction additionally requires naturality equations for the chosen family <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-powerset","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-powerset]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal U,\\mathcal R_H,\\mathcal R_G,\\operatorname{Ind},\\operatorname{Res},\\operatorname{Hom}_H,\\operatorname{Hom}_G,\\Phi\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_H,\\mathcal R_G\\subseteq\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FrobeniusReciprocity}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}frobenius\\text{-}reciprocity}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{FrobeniusReciprocity}_S(\\mathcal U,\\mathcal R_H,\\mathcal R_G,\\operatorname{Ind},\\operatorname{Res},\\operatorname{Hom}_H,\\operatorname{Hom}_G,\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&\\mathcal R_H\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\land\\mathcal R_G\\subseteq\\mathcal U\n\\land\\operatorname{Ind}:\\mathcal R_H\\to\\mathcal R_G\n\\land\\operatorname{Res}:\\mathcal R_G\\to\\mathcal R_H\\\\\n&\\land\\operatorname{Hom}_H:\\mathcal R_H\\times\\mathcal R_H\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal U)\n\\land\\operatorname{Hom}_G:\\mathcal R_G\\times\\mathcal R_G\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal U)\n\\land\\Phi:\\mathcal R_H\\times\\mathcal R_G\\to\\mathcal U\\\\\n&\\land\\forall U\\in\\mathcal R_H\\;\\forall W\\in\\mathcal R_G\\;\\Bigl[\n\\Phi(U,W):\\operatorname{Hom}_G(\\operatorname{Ind}(U),W)\\to\\operatorname{Hom}_H(U,\\operatorname{Res}(W))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall f,g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_G(\\operatorname{Ind}(U),W)\\;\\bigl(\\Phi(U,W)(f)=\\Phi(U,W)(g)\\to f=g\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_H(U,\\operatorname{Res}(W))\\;\\exists f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_G(\\operatorname{Ind}(U),W)\\;\\bigl(\\Phi(U,W)(f)=h\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false}],"bytes":2128,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-557","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-frobenius-reciprocity.md|58-df-frobenius-reciprocity]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751","2b6b1d9eb78a2714"]}